From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ArnoldasMk <arnoldas.kanobi@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: add Smart Pixels overlay and QS tile

Add a LieppOS Smart Pixels implementation backed by Settings.Secure.
SystemUI starts a trusted black-pixel overlay, exposes a smart_pixels QS tile,
and uses the same smart_pixel_filter_enabled / percent keys as the LieppOS app.

